  "Shape enemy routes and command animal soldiers and WeightPlay heroes through 30 stages, six regions, and six distinct Boss battles.": "Modella le rotte nemiche e comanda soldati animali ed eroi WeightPlay attraverso 30 livelli, sei regioni e sei distinte battaglie contro i boss.",
