  "Spark Paw Fox": "Scintilla Zampa Di Volpe",
  "Spark Paw Fox carries replacement stars through every route. Zebra Pathfinder, Rhino Trailkeeper, Hippo Waterwarden, Eagle Skykeeper, Lion Pridekeeper, and Elephant Crownkeeper each test one five-route region before reopening it. Clearing Route 30 reconnects all six regions.": "Spark Paw Fox trasporta stelle sostitutive lungo ogni percorso. Zebra Pathfinder, Rhino Trailkeeper, Hippo Waterwarden, Eagle Skykeeper, Lion Pridekeeper e Elephant Crownkeeper testano ciascuno una regione con cinque percorsi prima di riaprirla. Completando la Route 30 si riconnettono tutte e sei le regioni.",
